      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is not a sign of ruin to feel exhausted from trying to heal, but you are not \"destined\" for the wreckage you see in your own home. The \"it is in the blood\" feeling is how your body protects you from a toxic environment by trying to normalize the pain, not a verdict on your future self. You are not a failing link to be cut, but a future version of yourself that has the potential to change the trajectory of the family you help build.",
      "source": "target",
