    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, i just feel like i'm a magnet for everything bad. like, if i weren't here, maybe the energy would be different. maybe they wouldn't have to deal with my mistakes or my mess. sometimes it feels like the only way to actually stop the damage from spreading is to just... stop being a part of it. to just end the line so nothing else can get poisoned by me.",
